      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Reviewing this report. Please post any relevant information you might have. In particular, I need:\n- **Reproduction steps.** Steps to cause this issue to happen on demand. Can I follow some sequence of events to trigger this behavior? If yes, tell me those events. \n- **Full logs and notations of when the incident occured, down to the minute.** In particular, I need: date, time, timezone, userID of the person who experienced it, instance ID that you were trying to join. These are all included in the logs.\n- The state of the instance (population, mostly) when attempting to join. \nPlease don't post incomplete or unverified information, it will make it harder for us to solve this issue!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
