      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: On the nights it has happened, it happens all night no matter how many instances we start but always to a different person. Other nights it happens to no one. We created instances for 2 hours straight and can get VODs of when it happened. Sadly those logs are gone now but if it happens again we can try to get those individuals to send logs in. This is also during Peak hours, on a Saturday. But went fine Monday. Both Nights we had a full 81 in Lobby (including map creator to get to 81). If it happens again it'll be reproduceable until it's not. If that makes sense.",
      "viewerReactions": null
