      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Unfortunately, we don't know what the trigger is to cause the issue, so I cannot provide repro steps. The issue, in my experience, has occurred in RP lobbies, typically before RP starts, when all users are gathering in the specific instance. To my knowledge, this doesn't happen in every single RP session, but it could be I am unaware of someone being affected. \nWhen it does happen, the issue will affect those specific users all night for that instance, unless we make a new instance. However, when we make a new instance, this issue will then affect other users and the previously impacted users will be fine.\nWe had this issue happen to someone last night in a lobby and I requested their output log. Canny only allows uploading of images to post, so please let me know where you'd like me to send this log.\nLast night particularly, we were initially over soft cap (40+, below 80), recreated the instance, and were running into the issue for a user while under the soft cap of 40.\nMoving forward, we can request affected users to gather their logs, have someone check the instance population count at the time, and provide this information as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
