      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've been experiencing similar issues as well.\nI don't know if this is relevant but we've noticed that players entering the instance using the same internet connection will be sent to a different instance after a seemingly random cap. For us this varied from around 5 to 10 players, with the world cap set at 20. Those using a different connection could connect to the instance no problem. This happened in both public and private instances.\nI can provide logs if needed.",
